  <data name="lblCalculatedFieldsInfo.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Some Manager Pages contain fields which must be recalculated each time the page is loaded. One 
example is the Balance to Invoice field in the Progress Invoices Manager Page. When there are a
large number of Progress Invoices in the database, calculations such as this one may have a
significant impact on the time it takes to load the page.&lt;/br&gt;
&lt;/br&gt;
If users report that the Manager Page for a record type loads slowly try unchecking the checkbox for
it in this tab. If the box is unchecked, PMWeb will not calculate the relevant fields in the manager
page and will instead load "0" in those fields. This should speed up page load times.</value>
